Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix(RE6-003): verify Vercel deploys through structured
 API state

Replace grep ready with REST API checks of env values (hash), deployment
id/project/target/run/sha, READY + alias, promote target and page health.
Bound every CLI call; on unclear results look the deployment up by run id
and journal it, keeping the old source fenced.

